{
  "_README": "REQUIRED EDIT: replace the placeholder entry in AETMap below with one entry per modality that will C-STORE to this edge. Modalities whose AET is not listed are REJECTED for ingest but NOT discarded: the original instance is written to <FacilityBackupDir>/__unmapped_aet__/<AET>/<PatientID>/<StudyUID>/<SOPUID>.dcm and only then removed from Orthanc, and if that quarantine write fails the instance is kept in Orthanc instead. Add the AET here and re-send to ingest it. Underscore-prefixed keys are inline docs and are ignored by the Lua hook. The deidentification profile is loaded from a single file (config/orthanc/deidentification-profile.json) and applied to every accepted study — no per-AET profile selection in the MVP.",

